This repository is the Elixpo community umbrella / monorepo. It has no
root-level dependency manifest (no top-level package.json or requirements.txt)
and therefore no significant third-party runtime dependencies of its own.

Each product and shared service lives in its own sub-directory and ships its
own dependency manifest and, where relevant, its own third-party notices. Refer
to the per-project manifest for the authoritative dependency list and versions,
for example:

  * accounts.elixpo, admin.elixpo, agent.elixpo, art.elixpo, blogs.elixpo,
    chat.elixpo, claudeOps.elixpo, jackey.elixpo, lixrl.com, mails.elixpo,
    me.elixpo, payouts.elixpo, rewrite.elixpo, sketch.elixpo, wish.elixpo,
    elixpo  - see each directory's package.json
  * rewrite.elixpo, search.elixpo, tommy.elixpo  - see each directory's
    requirements.txt

Those sub-projects build on widely used open-source components (for example
Next.js / React / Tailwind CSS / Node tooling under MIT, and Python libraries
under their respective licenses). The authoritative, versioned list always
lives in each sub-project's own manifest.

If you believe a component is missing from this list, please open an issue or
email hello@elixpo.com.
